# docs/TOOL_CALL_SUCCESS_RENDERING_DESIGN_PROPOSAL.md); offline evidence
# tooling with a focused test, same shipped-diagnostic posture as
# inspect_conversation.py.
!/debug/tool_call_success_report.py
