# ── Eval / bench workdirs (large, causes FUSE timeouts) ──
# Glob covers every eval/bench harness output dir (swebench_workdir/,
# swebench_glm_ab_workdir/, swebench_pilot_workdir/, abtest_workdir/, …).
# These hold thousands of repo clones + conda envs (800K+ files combined)
# and are the #1 cause of grep/find FUSE timeouts — never track or scan them.
*_workdir/

